    "Ada": "Ada",
    "Ada and Leo each choose one secret bid for all three containers. They cannot see the other bid before both are submitted. A bid of $0 is allowed. Watch their bids reveal together.": "Ada 和 Leo 各自为全部三个集装箱秘密出价一次。双方提交前，彼此看不到出价。允许出价 $0。等待同时揭晓。",
    "Ada chooses you. You pay only your total bid of $10; the extra bid is not charged again. Leo pays nothing.": "Ada 选择了你。你只支付总出价 $10，追加金额不会重复收取。Leo 无需支付。",
    "Ada is auctioning two white containers and one tan container as a single shipment. Bid for all three, and remember she may keep them instead. You can ignore your value card for now: this chapter teaches bidding. The next chapters explain how containers score.": "Ada 将两个白色和一个浅褐色集装箱作为一批货物拍卖。为全部三个出价，同时记住她也可能自己留下货物。本章学习竞价，可以暂时忽略价值卡。后续章节会介绍集装箱如何计分。",
    "Ada offered $8; Leo offered $6. Accept Ada’s highest bid. She pays you $8 and gets all three containers on her island. The bank adds another $8: you receive $16 in total.": "Ada 出价 $8，Leo 出价 $6。接受 Ada 的最高出价。她向你支付 $8，并将三个集装箱放到自己的岛上。银行再补贴 $8，你共收到 $16。",
    "Ada pays her $6 bid and the bank matches it. How much cash do you receive in total?": "Ada 支付出价 $6，银行提供等额补贴。你一共收到多少现金？",
    "Ada sails into your harbour and buys the white container for $4. Loading immediately after sailing into a harbour costs no extra action. A ship holds up to five containers. Watch the white container move from your warehouse onto her ship.": "Ada 驶入你的港口，以 $4 买下白色集装箱。驶入港口后立即装货不额外消耗行动。一艘船最多装五个集装箱。白色集装箱将从你的仓库移到她的船上。",
    "Add the $6 bid and the $6 bank subsidy.": "将 $6 出价与 $6 银行补贴相加。",
    "Add white in the same action": "同一次行动再生产白色",
    "All five colours are present, so use the higher value on the card.": "五种颜色齐全，因此使用卡上的较高价值。",
    "ArrowLeft": "ArrowLeft",
    "ArrowRight": "ArrowRight",
    "At final scoring, remove every container of your most numerous island colour. All containers of that colour score $0, regardless of their card value. If colours tie, remove your $5/10 colour if it is tied; otherwise the game removes the lowest-valued tied colour. Which colour must you remove here?": "最终计分时，移除岛上数量最多的颜色的所有集装箱。无论价值卡如何标示，该颜色都计 $0。如果数量并列，优先移除其中价值为 $5/10 的颜色；否则移除并列颜色中价值最低的一种。这里必须移除哪种颜色？",
