    "Click Ada’s white container in her factory sales, then your warehouse-sales square marked 3. You pay $2 and offer it for $3. You can now keep both the brown and white containers for visiting ships to buy. Buying a warehouse does not produce or include any containers.": "点击 Ada 工厂销售区的白色集装箱，再点击你仓库销售区标有 3 的格子。支付 $2，并将售价设为 $3。现在可以同时存放棕色和白色集装箱，供来访船只购买。购买仓库不生产也不附带集装箱。",
    "Click Ada’s white container in her factory sales, then your warehouse-sales square marked 4. You pay her $2 and offer it for $4. The house-shaped row holds warehouse buildings. The squares below it hold containers for sale: their numbers are prices, not extra storage spaces. Your one warehouse holds one container.": "点击 Ada 工厂销售区的白色集装箱，再点击你仓库销售区标有 4 的格子。付给她 $2，并定价 $4。房屋形的一排放仓库建筑，下方方格放待售集装箱，数字代表价格，并非额外储存空间。你的一座仓库只能存一个集装箱。",
    "Click a white container in the supply, then your factory-sales square marked 3. This is still the same production action, with no extra $1 payment. More factories produce more stock; more warehouses let you buy and resell more stock from other players.": "点击供应区的白色集装箱，再点击工厂销售区标有 3 的格子。这仍属于同一次生产行动，无需再支付 $1。更多工厂可生产更多货物；更多仓库则能购买并转售更多其他玩家的货物。",
    "Click your blue ship, then the island harbour on the right and confirm the sailing move. Ada and Leo will bid for the entire cargo, just as in the previous auction.": "点击你的蓝船，再点击右侧岛屿港口，确认航行动作。Ada 和 Leo 将为整船货物出价，如同上次拍卖。",
    "Click your blue ship, then the island harbour on the right to start the auction. Confirm the sailing move. An island auction ends your turn even if it was your first action. The seller does not submit a bid.": "点击你的蓝船，再点击右侧岛屿港口以发起拍卖。确认航行动作。岛屿拍卖会结束你的回合，即使这只是第一次行动。卖方不参与出价。",
    "Click your blue ship, then the open sea in the centre of the board. Moving directly from one harbour to another is not allowed. This uses one of your two actions.": "点击你的蓝船，再点击中央的公海。不能直接从一个港口驶向另一个港口。这会消耗两次行动中的一次。",
