    "The orange row says $5/10: each orange scores $10 if you have all five colours on your island, or $5 otherwise. Check this before removing any containers. You have all five colours. What is each orange worth?": "橙色一行标为 $5/10：岛上集齐五色时每个橙色计 $10，否则 $5。移除集装箱前先判断。你已集齐五色，每个橙色价值多少？",
    "The subsidy rewards shipping": "补贴奖励航运",
    "The three dark-green containers contribute $0. White earns $20, orange $10, tan $6 and brown $4: $40 from the island. Add $20 cash, $2 for your warehouse container and $3 for the container on your ship; subtract $11 for your loan. Factory stock and buildings score nothing. Choose Pass in the top-right corner to see the final result.": "三个深绿色集装箱计 $0。白色计 $20，橙色 $10，浅褐色 $6，棕色 $4：岛屿共 $40。加上现金 $20、仓库货物 $2、船上货物 $3，再减去贷款 $11。工厂存货和建筑不计分。点击右上角“结束回合”查看最终结果。",
    "The two white containers are worth $20. The orange is worth $10 because it completes your five-colour set. Keeping adds $30 in containers, but costs $6 paid to the bank. What is the net gain?": "两个白色集装箱值 $20。橙色补齐五色，因此值 $10。保留货物增加 $30 集装箱价值，但需付给银行 $6。净增加多少？",
    "Tutorial": "教程",
    "Tutorial navigation": "教程导航",
    "Two colours in the supply are empty, so the game ends after this turn. Your island has 3 dark green, 2 white, 1 orange, 1 tan and 1 brown. Each player has a private card with different values for these colours. Your card determines your final score; the prices you paid at auction do not.": "供应区已有两种颜色耗尽，游戏在本回合结束后结算。你的岛上有 3 个深绿色、2 个白色、1 个橙色、1 个浅褐色和 1 个棕色集装箱。每人的秘密价值卡为各颜色赋予不同价值。最终得分取决于价值卡，而不是拍卖时支付的价格。",
    "Undo": "撤销",
    "Undo last move": "撤销上一步",
    "Unknown Container chapter": "未知的集装箱章节",
