    "Upkeep": "维护",
    "Use the board’s calculator: press 8, then Bid. Your offer is hidden from Leo until he has also bid. You only pay if Ada ultimately sells the cargo to you. You cannot bid more cash than you hold.": "使用面板上的计算器：按 8，再按“出价”。Leo 出价前看不到你的报价。只有 Ada 最后将货物卖给你时才需付款。出价不能超过持有现金。",
    "Use the new storage space": "使用新的存储空间",
    "Viewer mount point not found:": "找不到界面挂载点：",
    "Viewer mount point not found: {p0}": "找不到界面挂载点：{p0}",
    "WAREHOUSE SALES": "仓库销售区",
    "Wait for both sealed bids before deciding what to do with your shipment.": "等待双方提交密封出价，再决定如何处理货物。",
    "Wait for the other bidder": "等待另一位竞拍者",
