    "White containers": "白色集装箱",
    "Wrong argument for the command": "指令参数错误",
    "Wrong argument for the command {p0}": "指令 {p0} 的参数错误",
    "You": "你",
    "You already have three dark-green containers, one tan and one brown on your island. The ship’s white and orange containers would complete your five-colour set. This time, practise buying your own shipment.": "你的岛上已有三个深绿色、一个浅褐色和一个棕色集装箱。船上的白色和橙色可补齐五色。这次练习自己买下货物。",
    "You and Leo both offered $8. Only the tied highest bidders bid again. Use the board’s calculator to bid 2 more, then confirm the $10 total. Your new total is $10, not $2. You may add $0, but cannot lower your first bid.": "你和 Leo 都出价 $8。只有并列最高者再次竞价。用计算器追加 2，再确认总出价 $10。新的总价是 $10，而不是 $2。可以追加 $0，但不能降低首次出价。",
    "You are not allowed to run the command": "你无权执行此指令",
    "You are not allowed to run the command {p0}": "你无权执行指令 {p0}",
    "You bought a warehouse, then stock for it. Choose Pass in the top-right corner. Ada and Leo will pass so you can try expanding your factory next.": "你先购买仓库，再买入存货。点击右上角“结束回合”。Ada 和 Leo 会跳过，以便你下一步尝试扩大工厂。",
    "You expanded both businesses": "两项业务都扩大了",
    "You finish with $54": "你最终获得 $54",
    "You have $10 cash and three island containers. Ada received $20 including the subsidy. At the end of the game, every container of your most numerous island colour is removed. For example, with five white containers and four of each other colour, all five white containers are removed and score $0. The next chapters explain the rest of scoring.": "你有 $10 现金和三个岛上集装箱。Ada 包括补贴共收到 $20。游戏结束时，岛上数量最多的颜色会全部移除。例如五个白色，其他每色各四个时，五个白色全移除并计 $0。后续章节将说明其他计分规则。",
    "You have $14 left and all five colours on your island. Each orange now qualifies for $10. At final scoring, remove all three dark-green containers: they are your most numerous colour and score $0. To keep a shipment, you must be able to pay the highest bid. Loans give you $10, cost $1 interest each turn and deduct $11 each from your final score if unpaid.": "你剩下 $14，岛上五色齐全。每个橙色现在可计 $10。最终计分时，移除数量最多的三个深绿色，计 $0。想保留货物，必须有能力支付最高出价。每笔贷款提供 $10，每回合付 $1 利息；未还清的每笔贷款在最终得分中扣 $11。",
    "You have 3 dark green, 2 white, and 1 of each other colour. Remove the colour with the most containers.": "你有 3 个深绿色、2 个白色，其他每色各 1 个。移除数量最多的颜色。",
    "You have two factories and two warehouses, with $7 left. Your factories can make two colours and store four containers in total. Your warehouses hold two containers bought from other players. Building prices and container sale prices are separate.": "你有两座工厂、两座仓库，剩下 $7。工厂可以生产两种颜色，总共存放四个集装箱。仓库可存放两个从其他玩家买来的集装箱。建筑价格与集装箱售价是不同概念。",
    "You now have $36. Ada paid $8, Leo paid nothing, and your empty ship stays at the island. The next player’s turn begins. The bank subsidy goes only to the seller when another player buys the cargo.": "你现在有 $36。Ada 支付了 $8，Leo 没有付款，你的空船留在岛屿。下一位玩家开始回合。只有其他玩家买下货物时，卖方才能获得银行补贴。",
    "You paid $2 and sold for $4: a $2 trading margin. After the $1 production cost, you have $21. Your orange container is still for sale. Ships must pass through open sea between harbours; reaching the island auctions the entire cargo.": "花 $2 买入、以 $4 卖出，贸易差价为 $2。减去 $1 生产成本后，你有 $21。橙色集装箱仍在待售。船只在港口间移动必须经过公海；抵达岛屿后整船货物拍卖。",
    "You win": "你获胜了",
    "You won the cargo, not the game yet": "你赢得了货物，游戏还没结束",
    "Your": "你的",
    "Your $8 is submitted. Watch Leo submit his sealed bid; both first-round offers are then revealed.": "你的 $8 已提交。等待 Leo 提交密封出价后，双方首轮报价同时揭晓。",
    "Your buildings and stock": "你的建筑与存货",
    "Your cash": "你的现金",
    "Your cash: $": "你的现金：$",
    "Your extra $2 is secret until Leo submits his addition. Watch the second reveal.": "Leo 提交追加出价前，你额外的 $2 保密。等待第二次揭晓。",
    "Your final total": "你的最终总额",
    "Your final total is: $20 + $40 + $2 + $3 − $11 = $54. The highest final total wins. Aim for profitable trade and useful island cargo, while watching which colour will be discarded. The final-score table below shows every component.": "你的最终总额为 $20 + $40 + $2 + $3 − $11 = $54。总额最高者获胜。争取有利润的贸易和有用的岛上货物，同时留意哪种颜色将被移除。下方最终计分表列出了每个组成部分。",
    "Your final total: $": "你的最终总额：$",
    "Your first trade is complete": "你的第一笔贸易已完成",
    "Your island": "你的岛屿",
    "Your orange factory can produce one orange container. Click an orange container in the supply, then your factory-sales square marked 2. Production costs $1, paid to the player before you, and uses your first action.": "橙色工厂可生产一个橙色集装箱。点击供应区的橙色集装箱，再点击工厂销售区标有 2 的格子。生产花费 $1，支付给你的前一位玩家，并消耗第一次行动。",
    "Your orange factory makes orange containers. Click a white factory in the supply, then your empty circular factory slot to buy it. You may own only one factory of each colour. Each factory also adds two spaces to your factory sales stock.": "橙色工厂生产橙色集装箱。点击供应区的白色工厂，再点击自己的空圆形工厂格购买。每种颜色只能拥有一座工厂。每座工厂还增加两个工厂销售存货容量。",
    "Your own values, hidden from others": "你的价值，对他人保密",
    "Your private value card": "你的秘密价值卡",
    "Your sale prices:": "你的售价：",
    "Your sale prices: {p0}": "你的售价：{p0}",
    "Your ship is already loaded at Ada’s harbour. Two white containers and one orange container will be sold together. You are the seller: everyone else bids, then you decide whether to sell or buy the cargo yourself.": "你的船已在 Ada 的港口装好货。两个白色和一个橙色集装箱将一起出售。你是卖方：其他人先出价，再由你决定卖出还是自己买下。",
    "Your warehouse is full with one brown container. Each warehouse holds one container. Click a warehouse in the supply, then your empty house-shaped building slot to buy it for $4 and increase capacity to two. Buying a building uses one action.": "你的仓库被一个棕色集装箱占满。每座仓库存一个集装箱。点击供应区的仓库，再点击自己的空房屋形建筑格，花 $4 购买并将容量增加到二。购买建筑消耗一次行动。",
